<title>UK: Britain's RPS plans to buy Dutch group BAK.</title>
<headline>Britain's RPS plans to buy Dutch group BAK.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>British environmental consultancy company RPS Group Plc said on Tuesday it signed a conditional letter of intent to buy Dutch environmental engineering company BAK Nederland Beheer B.V (BAK).</p>
<p>RPS said it expected to pay under 10 million guilders for the company, paying half on a deferred basis. Talks were continuing and contract was expected to be finalised by the end of April, RPS said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
